Your pushes are now end-to-end encrypted: only devices you sign in on can read them. Signing in sets up your keys from your password and shows a recovery key. Save it: it is the only way to read your pushes if you forget your password.

New in the menu: Delete account, beside Change password and Show a new recovery key. Link icons now come straight from the linked site, not through Google.

Notifications and search work on encrypted pushes, and a share that fails is kept and retried.
